name: Direct session work stops before a request and keeps the question editable
size: 120x36
require-env: KUZUSHI_DEVEX_TARGET
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/unbound_session_allowance.py @TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/question-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 No provider request started | blocked-question
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/unbound_session_allowance.py @TARGET @ART blocked
submit: answers
require-live-snap: 25 Explain the owned greeting | editable-question
keys: Enter End
type:  kept α
require-live-snap: 25 kept α | edited-question
keys: C-z Escape
require-live-snap: 25 Explain the owned greeting | retained-question
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 25 Explain the owned greeting | question-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 25 Explain the owned greeting | question-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 25 Explain the owned greeting | question-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 25 Explain the owned greeting | question-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 25 Explain the owned greeting | question-40x12
ask: Is the unstarted budget refusal distinct from a provider failure, with the original question editable through every viewport?
resize: 120x36
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 6 committed / 6 calls | unchanged-report
expect: 0 protected review remaining
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | unsent-question-exit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: answers
require-live-snap: 25 Explain the owned greeting | recovered-question
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 6 committed / 6 calls | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/unbound_session_allowance.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the blocked question, human decision and exhausted allowance without new requests or automatic work?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | recovered-question-exit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
